When you run the
[codemod](https://developer.atlassian.com/cloud/framework/atlassian-frontend/codemods/intro-to-codemods/),
it goes into every single color in the target files and suggests tokens based on context of the
surrounding code.

This is what it can look like after applying and reviewing the codemod suggestions.

<CodeBlock language="diff" text={codeTokensCodemmod} shouldWrapLongLines />
<br></br>

Use `@hypermod/cli` to run the codemods.

